  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preserving Natural Resources while Generating Sustainable Livelihoods</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This amendment provides Sawyers LFMCBS with an additional 30 months and $170,000 to expand upon successful activities. Building on its expansion of apiary production and marketing, Sawyers will continue to refine management of its apiary and increase its honey sales. Sawyers will also purchase new equipment and conduct additional training to reinvigorate its greenhouse and extend its agroforestry work in the community.</narrative>
  </description>
